1535	   * Names are stored lowercase. The name "anonymous" is reserved.
1536	   *
1537	   * @param name - The user name to register (stored lowercase)
1538	   * @returns `{ result: "OK", name, token }` on success, or `{ result: "USER_ALREADY_EXISTS", message }`
1539	   * @throws {AgentrackError} NOT_INITIALIZED if no `.agentrack/` directory
1540	   *
1541	   * @example
